# Electron-ABI snapshot produced by scripts/prepare-windows-safe-apply-tests.mjs.
# Deliberately NOT inside build/ (also gitignored via the repo's top-level
# `build/` pattern) - `node-gyp rebuild` always runs a full clean first,
# which rimraf's the whole build/ directory, so anything meant to survive
# across the plain-Node <-> Electron ABI rebuild sequence must live outside
# it entirely.
electron-build/
